WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.980
Rory, old pal, how are you?

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:04.100
I am so good.

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:06.400
I am doing so great.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:07.460
I'm--
Really?

00:00:07.460 --> 00:00:10.490
I'm not mentally affected
or physically affected

00:00:10.490 --> 00:00:12.100
by the current state of the world.

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:13.720
I am terrific.

00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:15.800
I've been doing a lot of Zoom interviews,

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:17.860
with a lot of people.

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:19.810
Your setting looks the shittiest.

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:21.200
I'm gonna say that right now.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:22.680
And that's what I was going for.

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:23.725
(Conan laughs)

00:00:23.725 --> 00:00:25.260
There's a lot people out there...

00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:29.000
Look, here's who you've had
as guests, Conan, liars.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.610
They wanna decorate back here.

00:00:30.610 --> 00:00:32.650
They wanna go, "Things are great!"

00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:33.790
It's like Instagram,

00:00:33.790 --> 00:00:35.170
