00:00:35.170 --> 00:00:37.080
Not me, not me.

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:38.570
I didn't even put that there,

00:00:38.570 --> 00:00:40.410
for anyone who can read it.

00:00:40.410 --> 00:00:41.750
Well, you can barely read it.

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:43.680
I love that even your sign,

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:45.464
promoting your new show "Robbie"

00:00:45.464 --> 00:00:46.297
(Rory laughs)

00:00:46.297 --> 00:00:47.480
on Comedy Central

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:50.090
is impossible to read.

00:00:50.090 --> 00:00:51.150
I didn't put that there.

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:53.150
I would never take credit for that.

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:54.010
All right, well, listen,

00:00:54.010 --> 00:00:56.680
we've got a lot to talk
about, you rascal you.

00:00:56.680 --> 00:00:58.400
I was thinking about your life.

00:00:58.400 --> 00:00:59.440
You're a road comic.

00:00:59.440 --> 00:01:01.530
You're constantly on the go.

00:01:01.530 --> 00:01:03.040
You're always away from your daughter.

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:06.160
It must be so nice for you
to be spending time with her.

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:07.003
It is.

00:01:07.890 --> 00:01:11.816
My wife probably wishes I
could get back out on the road

00:01:11.816 --> 00:01:13.260
right about now.

00:01:13.260 --> 00:01:14.570
But yeah, with my daughter,

00:01:14.570 --> 00:01:17.300
we're playing games nonstop.

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:19.700
And yeah, we're...

00:01:19.700 --> 00:01:20.670
When you're gone,

00:01:20.670 --> 00:01:22.395
You go on the road, you come back.

00:01:22.395 --> 00:01:24.100
That's what the relationship is.

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:28.470
To actually be home, is a
whole new type of relationship,

00:01:28.470 --> 00:01:29.570
and it's great.

00:01:29.570 --> 00:01:30.670
It's the best.
Good.

00:01:30.670 --> 00:01:31.503
Oh, there she is.

00:01:31.503 --> 00:01:32.920
Hi, hi, Elliot!

00:01:32.920 --> 00:01:33.753
Do you see Conan?

00:01:33.753 --> 00:01:35.200
Say, "Hi, Conan."
Hi!

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:36.033
Hi.

00:01:36.033 --> 00:01:37.330
You look pretty, Elliott.

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:38.400
Thanks.

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:39.470
This is mine.

00:01:39.470 --> 00:01:40.471
Who told you, you could borrow that?

00:01:40.471 --> 00:01:41.304
(Conan laughs)

00:01:41.304 --> 00:01:42.603
[Conan O'Brien] She stole--

00:01:42.603 --> 00:01:43.580
It's mine!
No.

00:01:43.580 --> 00:01:44.413
