00:01:44.413 --> 00:01:45.447
That's terrible.

00:01:45.447 --> 00:01:46.805
Please, daddy.
What?

00:01:46.805 --> 00:01:48.073
Do you wanna play hide-and-go-seek?

00:01:48.073 --> 00:01:49.070
Hide-and-go-seek?

00:01:49.070 --> 00:01:51.860
I am talking to Conan.

00:01:51.860 --> 00:01:54.900
But why don't you hide,

00:01:54.900 --> 00:01:57.692
and then I will come and get you?

00:01:57.692 --> 00:02:00.360
Are you really gonna try to find me?

00:02:00.360 --> 00:02:04.300
Or are you just gonna tickle
me into a tickle fest?

00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:05.133
Well, I'll do both.

00:02:05.133 --> 00:02:06.880
If I find you, you are getting tickled.

00:02:06.880 --> 00:02:08.273
Okay.
Yeah.

00:02:08.273 --> 00:02:09.106
Bye.

00:02:09.106 --> 00:02:10.009
You better get out of here.

00:02:10.009 --> 00:02:10.905
Get!

00:02:10.905 --> 00:02:12.025
Ya get!

00:02:12.025 --> 00:02:13.180
(Conan laughs)

00:02:13.180 --> 00:02:14.013
So she's gonna go and hide?

00:02:14.013 --> 00:02:15.500
Oh, I didn't want America to see

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:17.390
