Here's the thing,

00:02:22.273 --> 00:02:24.740
hide-and-go-seek is one of the best games.

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:28.590
These kids, they don't know
how long it takes to be found.

00:02:28.590 --> 00:02:31.073
And if they commit to the hiding place,

00:02:31.073 --> 00:02:33.170
it's a good hour, two hours,

00:02:33.170 --> 00:02:35.360
of just catching up on some golf.

00:02:35.360 --> 00:02:36.560
You know what I mean?

00:02:36.560 --> 00:02:38.060
Well, I don't think that's a...

00:02:38.060 --> 00:02:39.840
So, wait, you just are gonna let her

00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:41.620
hide somewhere in the house

00:02:41.620 --> 00:02:43.857
for up to two, three hours, while you--

00:02:43.857 --> 00:02:46.100
Yeah, and her adrenaline
is pumping the whole time.

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:47.360
My adrenaline's pumping,

00:02:47.360 --> 00:02:48.890
because I'm getting some stuff done.

00:02:48.890 --> 00:02:51.260
I'm watching TV, and...

00:02:51.260 --> 00:02:53.080
You know?
Okay, yeah.

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:56.760
That sounds--
One time, she came out.

00:02:56.760 --> 00:02:58.000
She was hiding, and she came out.

00:02:58.000 --> 00:03:00.073
And I was having ice cream,

00:03:00.073 --> 00:03:01.750
and that was very traumatizing for her.

00:03:01.750 --> 00:03:02.583
For her.

00:03:02.583 --> 00:03:04.230
Not for you.
No.

00:03:04.230 --> 00:03:05.130
For her.

00:03:05.130 --> 00:03:08.870
The best for me.
All right, well, I...

00:03:08.870 --> 00:03:10.390
You should go and...

00:03:10.390 --> 00:03:12.180
Why are you drinking out of a jar?

00:03:12.180 --> 00:03:14.010
Vodka in a jar.

00:03:14.010 --> 00:03:15.110
Starting a new company.

00:03:15.110 --> 00:03:17.160
It's called Vodka In A Jar.

00:03:17.160 --> 00:03:20.441
Nothing says "issues" like
vodka in a jar. (laughs)

00:03:20.441 --> 00:03:22.586
(Conan laughs)

00:03:22.586 --> 00:03:24.736
I think you're gonna make a lot of money.

